WEBVTT

00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:28.750
MISSION 3
SEVEN VS THIRTEEN

00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:42.541
Meow,

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:45.500
now that we have made up,

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:47.916
there's no need for war.

00:00:48.791 --> 00:00:51.916
-Give your order to withdraw.
-Okay.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Also, don't forget to pay the killer
for his trouble.

00:00:57.083 --> 00:01:00.416
To earn a few bucks from you,
he had to dress up as dog and sing.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.500
Why killer had to dress up
as a dog and sing?

00:01:37.125 --> 00:01:39.500
Killer Thirteen.

00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:48.791
It's her.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:53.916
THIRTEEN - KILLER OF XUANWU
KILLER RANK: NO. 37

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.833
I only want the chief of dogs dead.
Out of my way!

00:01:57.916 --> 00:02:00.208
Is this one of your hired killers, too?

00:02:00.291 --> 00:02:03.250
No, I only hired an ugly killer.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:05.208
<i>Then it's probably not me.</i>

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:08.708
<i>That Mad Bark has so many enemies.</i>
<i>I should leave now.</i>

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:16.458
-Let's see who dares to hurt him.
-That's right!

00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:28.208
I don't mind if you want to
hand your life over.

00:02:50.458 --> 00:02:53.916
Wow, she's a true number 37
on the Assassin Raking List.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.541
We can't hold her back anymore.

00:03:42.875 --> 00:03:44.500
So close.

00:03:51.541 --> 00:03:55.125
Wait, I'm not Mad Bark.

00:03:55.208 --> 00:03:56.416
Look.

00:04:03.333 --> 00:04:08.041
Hey, this is who I really am.
Sorry, you got the wrong guy.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.958
You think you can fool me
by turning into an ugly dude?

00:04:12.458 --> 00:04:14.916
I'm really not Mad Bark!
Why won't you believe me?

00:04:20.708 --> 00:04:24.958
Super Invisibility!

00:04:32.666 --> 00:04:34.916
Why did he disappear? Invisibility?

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:44.375
How can I let him get away?
How would I explain it to my master?

00:04:48.625 --> 00:04:53.291
There's no invisibility.
This trick works every time.

00:04:53.375 --> 00:04:55.375
When she walks away, I will...

00:04:59.416 --> 00:05:00.500
You again?

00:05:01.541 --> 00:05:02.541
What do you want?

00:05:03.291 --> 00:05:04.125
Hell, no!

00:05:09.333 --> 00:05:12.166
It's rude to defecate in public places.

00:05:14.458 --> 00:05:17.916
You're quite tricky for a mutt.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.208
Almost had me fooled.

00:05:23.958 --> 00:05:26.250
I'm half of a durian.

00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:36.583
I already transformed
into so many things for you.

00:05:36.666 --> 00:05:39.250
Why won't you just believe
that I'm not Mad Bark?

00:05:51.875 --> 00:05:55.166
Wait, I have something to say.

00:05:55.833 --> 00:05:58.041
Actually, I...

00:06:05.833 --> 00:06:07.375
Wow, pretty girl!

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:13.833
I don't care if you're Mad Bark now.

00:06:14.875 --> 00:06:16.416
You're going to die.

00:06:16.916 --> 00:06:19.583
I'm Killer Seven.

00:06:19.666 --> 00:06:23.458
I'm No. 17,369 on the killer ranking list.

00:06:23.541 --> 00:06:26.458
My specialty is to cut see-through bangs.

00:06:26.541 --> 00:06:29.458
My constant quality service
and affordable prices

00:06:29.541 --> 00:06:31.208
have always been popular
among the villagers.

00:06:31.291 --> 00:06:33.833
My current relationship status is single.

00:06:33.916 --> 00:06:35.416
Let's get a drink
and share our experiences as killers...

00:06:37.833 --> 00:06:39.791
I just remembered that
I must go take care of something.

00:06:47.291 --> 00:06:51.083
Peace out! The next tea is on me.

00:06:51.166 --> 00:06:53.958
Don't forget to call me!

00:07:16.583 --> 00:07:19.916
I never thought I would need to use
the plum blossom dart on this guy.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:23.125
He's seen my face, so he must be silenced.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:35.458
My butt is numb.

00:07:35.541 --> 00:07:39.166
Looks like there's poison on the dart.

00:07:39.666 --> 00:07:42.000
Oh, no. Looks like
I have to use the ultimate move.

00:07:43.666 --> 00:07:47.333
Six, seven, five...

00:07:49.791 --> 00:07:52.083
Break it up, Scissors!

00:08:08.041 --> 00:08:09.875
It's harder to deal with
now that there are two of them.

00:08:09.958 --> 00:08:10.875
I must end this quickly.

00:08:48.208 --> 00:08:50.875
That was a great move just now. Not bad.

00:09:09.625 --> 00:09:12.000
<i>The strike is so fast.</i>
<i>I probably can't block it.</i>

00:09:24.041 --> 00:09:25.791
MUSCULAR CHICKEN
XIAO FEI ON THE RAGE

00:09:35.875 --> 00:09:37.708
What the hell is that?

00:09:46.125 --> 00:09:47.208
It's so fast!

00:10:03.916 --> 00:10:05.333
Fine, keep your sorry life
for a few more days.

00:10:22.041 --> 00:10:23.708
Come and have tea with me sometime!

00:10:25.833 --> 00:10:27.958
Why is that ugly killer here?

00:10:28.875 --> 00:10:31.208
My name is Seven!

00:10:31.291 --> 00:10:34.416
-My number is...
-Seven, I'll kill you for sure.
